ar its upper right edge; to its right is vertical handwritten Chinese text reading “普通鍋” (pǔtōng guō). All text is in traditional Chinese characters, handwritten in brush or pen style. No tables, axes, data points, legends, or enumerable data units are present.三种锅\n三的\n善\n铝\n\nID: 273\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nA vertical rectangular black-and-white ink drawing depicts a mountainous landscape with rugged peaks, textured slopes, and a winding path or stream descending through the terrain. At the bottom, a cluster of stylized figures appears to be moving along the path, rendered with dense cross-hatching and minimal detail. Along the left edge, a column of vertically oriented Chinese characters is inscribed in brush script; the visible text reads: “于二零一五年红军长征纪念” (Yu er ling yi wu nian hongjun changzheng jinian), followed by additional characters that are partially legible but not fully decipherable due to resolution and stroke overlap. The entire composition is framed by a thick, irregular black border. No tables, charts, axes, data points, legends, or enumerable data units are present.翻越夹金山\n法\nRP\n忘\n\nID: 363\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nThe image contains only Chinese text arranged in multiple paragraphs, with no tables, charts, graphs, labeled axes, data points, or other enumerable visual data units. At the bottom, a partial line of text reads “下雪山的喜悦”. The text includes quoted dialogue (e.g., “不对！危秀英矮小，邓六金一样高。”), names (e.g., 刘彩香, 危秀英, 邓六金, 王金玉, 李伯钊), and narrative descriptions involving distances (“六十里或六十五里”, “二万五千里”), actions (“登山”, “唱歌”, “唱小调”), and group movement (“全体部队到了宿营地”). No icons, UI elements, separators, grids, or structured visual encodings are present; all content is prose.下雪山的喜悦\n\n\nID: 3\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nTop-left corner: Chinese characters “泸定桥” (Lúdìng Qiáo).  \nTop-center, above the illustration: Chinese characters “老林之童” (Lǎo Lín zhī Tóng), written in a brush-script style.  \nMain area: a black-and-white ink sketch depicting a dense forest scene with tall, slender tree trunks and heavy foliage. Several small human figures are visible among the trees—some seated on the ground, others standing or crouching—grouped in clusters across the lower half of the image. The figures are rendered with minimal detail, using outlines and shading; no facial features or clothing details are discernible. The ground is uneven, suggested by curved lines and hatching. The composition uses strong contrast between dark ink areas (trunks, shadows, foliage) and white paper (sky gaps, highlights). No gridlines, axes, labels, legends, data markers, tables, or enumerated units are present.老林之夜\n泸定桥\n兴林之 [{\"chunk_id\": \"dcbdf0954d8526d3\", \"content_with_weight\": \"\\nThe image is predominantly white with no discernible visual data representation. At the bottom, aligned left within a light gray horizontal bar, three Chinese characters are visible: “杨”, “成”, “武”, separated by spaces. No other elements, labels, axes, data points, or structured components are present.杨成武\\n\", \"doc_id\": \"ebc378e2558411f1ab8757429e2e48f5\", \"docnm_kwd\": \"亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\", \"kb_id\": \"a13dd2343df311f18072d95ac726e166\", \"image_id\": \"a13dd2343df311f18072d95ac726e166-dcbdf0954d8526d3\", \"similarity\": 0.21570916999281367, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7188417, \"term_similarity\": 8.094284687660614e-05, \"positions\": [[442, 338, 539, 266, 537], [443, 403, 464, 549, 561]], \"doc_type_kwd\": \"image\", \"mom_id\": \"\"}, {\"chunk_id\": \"f4ea28dfe9b7528d\", \"content_with_weight\": \"\\nThe image contains a block of Chinese text in black serif font on a white background. The text is arranged in multiple left-aligned lines, with no visible headings, tables, charts, icons, or UI elements. At the bottom left, three characters “安 顺 场” appear in a slightly larger, bolded font, separated by spaces. No enumerable data units (e.g., rows, bars, points, segments) are pres